# REQUIRES: verilator
# Constant-shell fold, `--csf-single-bank`: an early link (a memory of several
# entries) all of whose reads of a frame come at least 3 host cycles before
# its producer writes the entry in that frame keeps one bank; the schedule
# decides link by link, the others keep two. Each design exact against its
# target, channels stalled or not.
# - stateless: block RAM links (`--link-block-depth 2`), half of them single;
# - linkpage: SLR groups and serialized crossings (crossing links keep two);
# - lanes: pass-split lanes feeding an early output, with bubbles.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/stateless
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/blk --static --no-drop-dead-inputs --no-staged-link-direct --nest --modulo --compact-links --link-block-depth 2 --csf-single-bank Sm Agu 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=BLK
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -Mdir %t/blk/obj %S/Inputs/tb_reset.sv top.sv %t/blk/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/blk/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/blk/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+6 +stall=0 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/blk/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+7 +stall=30 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/linkpage
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/s2 --static --nest --modulo --slr-groups --slr-count 2 --slr-assign Unit:0,Reader:1,Top_model:1 --slr-serialize 2 --csf-single-bank Unit Reader 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LP
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -Mdir %t/s2/obj %S/Inputs/tb_reset.sv top.sv %t/s2/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/s2/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/s2/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+1 +stall=0 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/s2/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+2 +verilator+seed+2 +stall=30 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/lanes
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/early --static --bubbles --pass-split Leaf:4 --csf-single-bank Leaf 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LANES
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/early/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/early/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/early/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/early/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+9 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: %t/early/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+10 +bubble=0 +stall=0 | FileCheck %s
# The netlists: a single-bank link's memory is as deep as its entries.
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=BLKSIM < %t/blk/foldsim_sim.mlir
# BLK: csf single-bank 6 (136 bits in one bank), two banks 6
# LP: csf single-bank 2 (64 bits in one bank), two banks 5
# LANES: csf single-bank 1 (32 bits in one bank), two banks 2
# BLKSIM: seq.firmem
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH
# CHECK-NOT: MISMATCH
